            "text": "DM-2138: Compare the explicit Text cut with the same runner's system-ui Display cut directionally. Absolute ring bounds and a fixed pixel gap vary with the installed SFNS revision; Text > Display is the stable invariant that catches collapse of the explicit family to the default optical master.",
            "markdown": "DM-2138: Compare the explicit Text cut with the same runner's system-ui Display cut directionally. Absolute ring bounds and a fixed pixel gap vary with the installed SFNS revision; Text > Display is the stable invariant that catches collapse of the explicit family to the default optical master."
